# Jackdaw Savior copied by Bot1's Phantasmal Image (MV 2, a copy has MV 3, CR 707.2): the Image dies and its own copied trigger
# may not return "another target creature card" = the Image card itself (the card the source became, CR 400.7; cf. Fiendish Panda,
# Morcant's Loyalist found_all_after_move). Nothing else is in the graveyard, so the trigger has no target.

